    "Pomodoro Planner can suggest a search query for a task. Nothing is sent until you tap Search Google.\n\nThe query leaves Pomodoro Planner and is handled under Google’s privacy terms. Generated plans, survey answers, and focus history stay on this device.\n\nPomodoro Planner does not inspect, save, or endorse the results. For health, legal, financial, or safety-sensitive goals, treat results as starting points only." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Pomodoro Planner can suggest a search query for a task. Nothing is sent until you tap Search Google.\n\nThe query leaves Pomodoro Planner and is handled under Google’s privacy terms. Generated plans, survey answers, and focus history stay on this device.\n\nPomodoro Planner does not inspect, save, or endorse the results. For health, legal, financial, or safety-sensitive goals, treat results as starting points only."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Planificador Pomodoro puede sugerir una consulta de búsqueda para una tarea. No se envía nada hasta que pulses Buscar en Google.\n\nLa consulta sale de Planificador Pomodoro y se trata según las condiciones de privacidad de Google. Los planes generados, las respuestas de la encuesta y el historial de enfoque se quedan en este dispositivo.\n\nPlanificador Pomodoro no inspecciona, guarda ni respalda los resultados. En objetivos de salud, legales, financieros o sensibles para la seguridad, trata los resultados solo como punto de partida."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Pomodoro Planner could not open easefocus.store. Your store files were preserved." : {
